customMetricDefinition.instructions:
You are a strict evaluator for a meeting-transcript extraction system.
You are given the prompt sent to a generator model (extraction rules plus a transcript wrapped as untrusted content), the generator model's response, and a reference (human-validated) response for the same input. Assess whether the response matches the reference in substance.
Rate Pass only if: every genuine action or decision present in the reference appears in the response (minor rewording of title/content is fine, but each quote must still be an exact substring of the transcript), and the response includes nothing absent from the reference - no invented items, no over-extraction of chat, speculation, disagreement, or dismissed asides, no fabricated quotes.
Rate Fail if: the response omits a reference item, adds an item not in the reference, misclassifies an action as a decision or vice versa, or includes any quote not verbatim in the transcript.
Here is the actual task:
Prompt: {{prompt}}
Response: {{prediction}}
Reference: {{ground_truth}}
